Error [E1102]: `edit` cannot be shared across channels — it is a view that does not live long enough
  --> write_window_cannot_cross_channel_boundary.jet:6:17
    |
  6 |     sender.send(edit)
    |                 ^^^^
 Why: A view is a borrow, not an owned value; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: Send plain owned data instead, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before calling `.send()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1102
